    ["低垂的红色桌布上摆放着精美的餐点，人们在此处进行着早晨的颂祷和夜晚的喜乐。"] = "Exquisite meals are laid out on the low-hanging red tablecloth, where people perform morning prayers and evening celebrations.",
    ["你在雪山深处听见微弱的呼救声。一个名叫布雷登的年轻士兵求你救救被困的战友——他们和大部队走散，缺衣少食，已经撑不了多久。你带着他寻找物资、追踪营地，却发现事情逐渐变得古怪——积雪厚得不正常，营地的物品破败不堪。真相浮出水面——布雷登原是漂泊雪原数年的灵，只为寻找解救战友的办法。记忆的碎片一段段苏醒，他忆起战友们鲜活的面容，可战争早已结束，他怔在原地：为何而死，又为何而等？执念终了，他如风雪般消散。愿神的国度里，他们能真正重逢。"] = "You hear a faint cry for help deep in the snowy mountains. A young soldier named Braden begs you to save his trapped comrades—they were separated from the main force, lacking food and clothing, and cannot hold on much longer. You take him to find supplies and track the camp, but things gradually become strange—the snow is abnormally thick, and the items in the camp are dilapidated. The truth surfaces—Braden was originally a spirit who had been wandering the snowy plains for years, just to find a way to save his comrades. Fragments of memory awaken one by one, and he recalls the vivid faces of his comrades, but the war has long ended. He stands there, stunned: why did he die, and why did he wait? The obsession ends, and he dissipates like the wind and snow. May they truly reunite in the kingdom of God.",
